{"name":"Dark Cavern","hex":"#55504d","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dark","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having an absolute or (more often) relative lack of light.","Extinguished."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A complete or (more often) partial absence of light.","Ignorance."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dark"},{"term":"cavern","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large cave.","An underground chamber."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To form a cavern or deep depression in.","To put into a cavern."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cavern"}],"entries":[{"title":"Night Stalker (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Night Stalker is a top-down maze shooter video game designed by Steve Montero and released for the Intellivision console in 1982. It was ported to the Atari 2600 as Dark Cavern and released under Mattel's M Network label. Apple II, IBM PC, and Mattel Aquarius versions were published in 1983."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1a/Night_Stalker_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Night_Stalker_(video_game)"},{"title":"Cave","blocks":[{"text":"Caves and caverns are natural voids under the surface of the Earth and have also been observed in other rocky worlds. Caves often form by the weathering of rock and can extend deep underground. Exogene caves are smaller openings that extend a relatively short distance underground. Caves which extend farther underground than the opening is wide are called endogene caves."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Lechuguilla_Cave_Pearlsian_Gulf.jpg/330px-Lechuguilla_Cave_Pearlsian_Gulf.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cave"},{"title":"Darkness","blocks":[{"text":"Darkness is the condition resulting from a lack of illumination, or an absence of visible light."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Creation_of_Light.png/330px-Creation_of_Light.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darkness"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/0d/Dark_Cavern_1982_Atari_2600.png/330px-Dark_Cavern_1982_Atari_2600.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/0d/Dark_Cavern_1982_Atari_2600.png/330px-Dark_Cavern_1982_Atari_2600.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Dark Cavern port on the Atari 2600","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADark_Cavern_1982_Atari_2600.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/HallOfTheMountainKings.jpg/500px-HallOfTheMountainKings.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/HallOfTheMountainKings.jpg/500px-HallOfTheMountainKings.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Speleothems in Hall of the Mountain King of Ogof Craig a Ffynnon, a solutional cave in South Wales.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHallOfTheMountainKings.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Hawaiian_lava_tube.jpg/500px-Hawaiian_lava_tube.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Hawaiian_lava_tube.jpg/500px-Hawaiian_lava_tube.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Exploring a lava tube in Hawaii.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHawaiian_lava_tube.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Painted_cave.jpg/500px-Painted_cave.jpg?ut